  <!-- The parent half of the aggregate. Merge, not replace: this adds one tag and touches nothing
       else on the vanilla blueprint. Without it the variants would aggregate only with each other
       and the vanilla creature would keep a separate slot, which is the table inflation the whole
       arrangement exists to avoid. -->
